{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47312","headline":"登北固山望海 · 吴筠","name":"登北固山望海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此山镇京口，逈出沧海湄。\n跻览何所见，茫茫潮汐驰。\n云生蓬莱岛，日出扶桑枝。\n万里混一色，焉能分两仪。\n愿言策烟驾，缥缈寻安期。\n挥手谢人境，吾将从此辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}